# Grammar-relevant adverbs: negation (docs/LEXICON_FORMAT_FR.md §6). Own knowledge (clean-room).
guère     adv  type=neg
jamais    adv  type=neg
ne        adv  type=neg elided=n'
nullement adv  type=neg
pas       adv  type=neg
plus      adv  type=degree|neg
point     adv  type=neg style=literary note=ne … point
